  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526418",
      "title": "Using v-model on Custom Components",
      "lectureOrder": 149,
      "videoOrder": 130,
      "sourceHash": "78d75f585e5f6d6ce3637fafaf82d2d4a3ad4e3ddaa9ae6a23ce164db19cfa58",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4,
          "en": "Well, it would be nice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4,
          "end": 7.27,
          "en": "if we could use our own control, the rating control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.27,
          "end": 9.57,
          "en": "just like the built in inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.57,
          "end": 12.31,
          "en": "So if I could use the model on this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.19,
          "end": 16.41,
          "en": "and then simply bind the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.41,
          "end": 19.62,
          "en": "that this control has internally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.62,
          "end": 23.12,
          "en": "to some data property I store here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.12,
          "end": 26.4,
          "en": "so that I have a rating here initially, it's null,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.4,
          "end": 31.4,
          "en": "and I bind rating with v-model to the rating control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.9,
          "end": 35.71,
          "en": "It would be nice if we could use it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.71,
          "end": 38.74,
          "en": "And we can, you might remember",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.74,
          "end": 41.2,
          "en": "that at the beginning of the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.2,
          "end": 42.96,
          "en": "relatively at the beginning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.96,
          "end": 47.06,
          "en": "I explained that v-model on an input element was",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.06,
          "end": 49.46,
          "en": "in the end, just a short cut.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.46,
          "end": 52.05,
          "en": "It was a short cut for a manually listening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.05,
          "end": 55.9,
          "en": "to the input event and binding the value attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.9,
          "end": 57.67,
          "en": "You might remember this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.67,
          "end": 59.95,
          "en": "I mentioned this at the beginning v-model is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.95,
          "end": 62.14,
          "en": "just a shortcut for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.14,
          "end": 64.93,
          "en": "and that's something we can leverage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.93,
          "end": 67.84,
          "en": "Now the input event and the value prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.84,
          "end": 71.253,
          "en": "That's specific to input elements here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.1,
          "end": 76.78,
          "en": "but if you use v-model on a custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.78,
          "end": 79.81,
          "en": "that is something which is supported by Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.03999999999999,
          "end": 84.39,
          "en": "and Vue will set a very specific prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.39,
          "end": 86.67,
          "en": "If you use v-model on a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.67,
          "end": 89.88,
          "en": "it will set the very specific prop in that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 92.65,
          "en": "And it will listen to a very specific event,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.65,
          "end": 94.803,
          "en": "which you can emit in that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.1,
          "end": 99.45,
          "en": "Now, which prop is that and which event is that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.45,
          "end": 101.66,
          "en": "Let's go to rating control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.66,
          "end": 104.55,
          "en": "as I just said, v-model we'll set a specific prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.55,
          "end": 107.06,
          "en": "So therefore we should declare that prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.06,
          "end": 111.473,
          "en": "and that prop, which will be set is the model value prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.41,
          "end": 116.32,
          "en": "So using v-model on a custom component is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.32,
          "end": 121.28,
          "en": "like manually binding the model-value prop like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 122.8,
          "end": 124.66,
          "en": "that's one thing v-model does",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.66,
          "end": 127.393,
          "en": "under the hood on custom components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.25,
          "end": 132.46,
          "en": "The other thing is the special event that's submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.52,
          "end": 139.52,
          "en": "that is the update model value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 142.11,
          "en": "Yes, this looks strange,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.11,
          "end": 144.62,
          "en": "but you can name your events, however you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.62,
          "end": 147.99,
          "en": "And this is the name Vue will be waiting for,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 147.99,
          "end": 151.23,
          "en": "when you use v-model on a custom component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.23,
          "end": 155.51,
          "en": "So using v-model here is like manually binding model value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.51,
          "end": 158.85,
          "en": "the model value prop and listening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.85,
          "end": 162.123,
          "en": "to the update model value custom event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.7,
          "end": 164.8,
          "en": "If you use that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 164.8,
          "end": 167.223,
          "en": "it's the same as if you use v-model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 168.15,
          "end": 172.42000000000002,
          "en": "So therefore, if we accept this prop in our component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.42000000000002,
          "end": 176.78,
          "en": "and emit this event, we can use v-model on our component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.06,
          "end": 180.68,
          "en": "and therefore back rating control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.68,
          "end": 184.95,
          "en": "All we got to do here is we have to emit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 186.09,
          "end": 191.09,
          "en": "this update model value event in our activate method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 191.18,
          "end": 193.883,
          "en": "And forward this option to v-model,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 195.02,
          "end": 197.95,
          "en": "and also initialize our active option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 197.95,
          "end": 201.65,
          "en": "with the model value we get on the prop here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 201.65,
          "end": 203.52,
          "en": "so that the form component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 203.52,
          "end": 207.6,
          "en": "So this component here is able to set our initial value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 207.6,
          "end": 210.09,
          "en": "so that this rating initial value here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 210.09,
          "end": 214.32,
          "en": "which we bind to v-model is the initial value reflected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 214.32,
          "end": 215.583,
          "en": "in our component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.787,
          "end": 219.02,
          "en": "And if we do all of that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.02,
          "end": 220.91,
          "en": "we can go back to the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.91,
          "end": 225.243,
          "en": "and now start console logging this console log rating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.1,
          "end": 230.13,
          "en": "and console log this rating therefore whoops, this rating,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.13,
          "end": 233.47,
          "en": "and also reset rating to null their after",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.47,
          "end": 235.053,
          "en": "and see whether that works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 237.45,
          "end": 238.91,
          "en": "And if we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.91,
          "end": 241.77,
          "en": "we can choose our different options.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 241.77,
          "end": 242.7,
          "en": "But if I submit this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 242.7,
          "end": 246.11,
          "en": "we also see the option we picked here being output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.11,
          "end": 247.143,
          "en": "in the console.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 248.27,
          "end": 250.05,
          "en": "Now, what we also see though is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.05,
          "end": 253.03,
          "en": "that resetting doesn't seem to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 253.03,
          "end": 257.85,
          "en": "If I submit this, I do set rating back to null here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 257.85,
          "end": 260.903,
          "en": "but unfortunately this does not reset it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 262.33,
          "end": 267.06,
          "en": "And therefore our visual feedback is not in sync",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.06,
          "end": 269.133,
          "en": "with the value stored in rating here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 270.5,
          "end": 272.38,
          "en": "Now, why is this happening?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 272.38,
          "end": 275.15999999999997,
          "en": "Well, because we only use the model value prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 275.15999999999997,
          "end": 277.35,
          "en": "to initialize active option,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 277.35,
          "end": 281.24,
          "en": "but there after the model value is not reflected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 281.24,
          "end": 283.92,
          "en": "in our active option here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 283.92,
          "end": 285.623,
          "en": "And that's of course a problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 286.65999999999997,
          "end": 288.843,
          "en": "We can work around that though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 290.37,
          "end": 292.28,
          "en": "Instead of using the data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 292.28,
          "end": 295.92,
          "en": "which wouldn't react to changes in our model value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 295.92,
          "end": 297.96,
          "en": "which come from outside,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 297.96,
          "end": 301.479,
          "en": "we can simply use a computed property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.479,
          "end": 304.713,
          "en": "We can set up active option as a computed property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 305.58,
          "end": 307.003,
          "en": "Now what's my idea here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 308.26,
          "end": 311.74,
          "en": "Well, we are emitting this event here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 311.74,
          "end": 313.83,
          "en": "Whenever we pick a new option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.83,
          "end": 316.93,
          "en": "And this event is picked up by the model",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 316.93,
          "end": 319.06,
          "en": "and the option which we picked will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 319.06,
          "end": 322.44,
          "en": "then be stored in our rating data property there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.24,
          "end": 327.653,
          "en": "because it's that property which be bound to rating control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 329.13,
          "end": 333.01,
          "en": "Now v-model works such that this value is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 333.01,
          "end": 336.69,
          "en": "then fed back into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 336.69,
          "end": 339.05,
          "en": "So this prop value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 339.05,
          "end": 342.65,
          "en": "the model value prop value will be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 342.65,
          "end": 344.543,
          "en": "whenever we emitted this event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 345.93,
          "end": 348.65999999999997,
          "en": "So now we can just use active option here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 348.65999999999997,
          "end": 351.92,
          "en": "and return this.model value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 351.92,
          "end": 354.18,
          "en": "or of course, skip this altogether",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 356.15999999999997,
          "end": 358.246,
          "en": "and just use model value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 358.246,
          "end": 361.603,
          "en": "instead of active option here in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 363.19,
          "end": 366.54,
          "en": "That would also work because that holds the value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 366.54,
          "end": 368.403,
          "en": "which we passed here to activate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 370.08,
          "end": 372.63,
          "en": "And of course, then inactivate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 372.63,
          "end": 374.463,
          "en": "we can get rid of this line as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 376.71,
          "end": 378.563,
          "en": "So now if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 380.5,
          "end": 382.74,
          "en": "we can still select different options,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 382.74,
          "end": 385.54,
          "en": "but now if you reset it, this has cleared",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 385.54,
          "end": 389.113,
          "en": "and now this stale for in sync with the rest of our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 390.87,
          "end": 393.74,
          "en": "And that is how we can build custom controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 393.74,
          "end": 395.92,
          "en": "We build regular components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 395.92,
          "end": 398.57,
          "en": "and we listen to this special prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 398.57,
          "end": 401.17,
          "en": "or we use this special prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 401.17,
          "end": 404.27,
          "en": "and we emit this special event.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 404.27,
          "end": 406.003,
          "en": "That's the whole idea here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
